   settled:
     "The wound is on making, not on playing. A bounded game with rules and a way to win does not fire it.\n\nThe alarm is two layers: a floor that is pure structure, and a charge above it that is a belief and can be dissolved.\n\nThe alarm concentrates on setting up, before anything begins, and peaks as the setup finishes.\n\nEvery criticism of my work lands as a criticism of me.\n\nA judge I can neither escape nor deny installs and grades me from inside forever. One I can walk away from is gone.",
